{"id":"582b96e73e5d1c6e","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-provable.md","title":"Provable","display":"df-provable — Provable","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-provable","aliases":["58-df-provable"],"display":"df-provable — Provable","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-proof]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable — Provable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d63c357151e48e9d\" href=\"?note=d63c357151e48e9d\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md\">../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-proof\">../batch04/58-df-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,T,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{Hilbert}},\\mathrm{Ax}\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,T,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{Hilbert}},\\mathrm{Ax}\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofSystem}\\subseteq V^2\\land\\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\operatorname{ProofSystem}\\subseteq V^2\\land\\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (proof-system predicates, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d63c357151e48e9d\" href=\"?note=d63c357151e48e9d\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md\">../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{Hilbert}},T,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Ax})\">\\(\\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{Hilbert}},T,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Ax})\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (proof-object predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-proof.md\">../batch04/58-df-proof.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>下式给出原先声明但未连接到源谓词的三元 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span>；其隐去的签名参数始终为当前固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>，证明系统为下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofObject}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofObject}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-proof\">../batch04/58-df-proof</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable} \\vdash \\left(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,T,\\varphi)\\right)\\land\\left(T\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{Hilbert}}}\\varphi\\right)\\land\\left(\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\emptyset\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{Hilbert}}}\\varphi\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable} \\vdash \\left(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,T,\\varphi)\\right)\\land\\left(T\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{Hilbert}}}\\varphi\\right)\\land\\left(\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\emptyset\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{Hilbert}}}\\varphi\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,T,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,T,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\vdash \\varphi\">\\(T \\vdash \\varphi\\)</span> iff there exists a proof of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> from axioms <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash \\varphi\">\\(\\vdash \\varphi\\)</span> iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> is a theorem of pure logic (no non-logical axioms)</li>\n<li>Provability is defined via proof objects, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" href=\"?note=68fd6aebcf2cd4ac\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-proof.md\">../batch04/58-df-proof.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md","status":"resolved","id":"d63c357151e48e9d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-proof","status":"resolved","id":"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V$ (formula set, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md","status":"resolved","id":"d63c357151e48e9d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProofSystem}\\subseteq V^2\\land\\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}\\subseteq V^4$ (proof-system predicates, see [[../batch03/58-df-proof-system.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-proof.md","status":"resolved","id":"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq V^3$ (proof-object predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-proof","status":"resolved","id":"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ProofObject}$ 取 [[../batch04/58-df-proof]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-proof.md","status":"resolved","id":"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"Provability is defined via proof objects, see [[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,T,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{Hilbert}},\\mathrm{Ax}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProofSystem}\\subseteq V^2\\land\\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HilbertProofSystem}(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{Hilbert}},T,\\Sigma,\\mathrm{Ax})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofObject}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provable} \\vdash \\left(T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P}\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,T,\\varphi)\\right)\\land\\left(T\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow T\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{Hilbert}}}\\varphi\\right)\\land\\left(\\vdash\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\emptyset\\vdash_{\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{Hilbert}}}\\varphi\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,T,\\varphi)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProofObject}_S(\\pi,T,\\varphi,\\mathcal P,\\Sigma).","display":true},{"tex":"T \\vdash \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1967,"backlinks":[{"id":"d63c357151e48e9d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"Concrete proof objects are defined in [[../batch04/58-df-proof.md]], provability in [[../batch08/58-df-provable.md]], and arithmetized provability in [[../batch07/58-df-provability-predicate.md]]."},{"id":"e26933a629751c0c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T\\vdash\\varphi$ (可证性, see [[../batch08/58-df-provable.md]])"},{"id":"967fd715c999aad8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a4d3c71685246c85","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\vdash$ (provability relation, see [[./58-df-provable.md]])"},{"id":"57389b11bb1e9431","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"Provability uses the fixed proof system of [[../batch08/58-df-provable.md]]."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1014","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-provable.md|58-df-provable]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["d63c357151e48e9d","68fd6aebcf2cd4ac","65418b505fc53093"]}